OL,3,GNEWSAYellow weather warnings issued for
OL,4,Asnow and ice as temperatures plummet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spell of cold and wintry weather is
OL,7,Fset to grip northern areas of the UK
OL,8,Fearly this week, bringing the threat of
OL,9,Fice and hill snow.
OL,11,FA yellow weather warning for ice is in
OL,12,Feffect until 10:00 GMT on Monday after
OL,13,FArctic air pushing across the UK on
OL,14,FSunday night caused temperatures to
OL,15,Fplummet.
OL,17,FCold health alerts for parts northern
OL,18,FEngland also remain in force from the
OL,19,FUK Health Security Agency (UKHSA) until
OL,20,F21:00 GMT on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
